    "detailed_description": "Once upon a time, there was a lonely witch and she wants to have friends to talk and play with.<br><br>Sadly, her timidness makes her being bashful everytime she tries to approach someone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/4882db4d36a36403dbb86588f0a72356.avif?t=1746332445\" width=614 height=154 /></span><br><br>Then one day, a brilliant idea popped out of the witch's head. With her skillful witchcraft, she decided to summon her own friends. But who or what will come out of the summoning portal?<br><br>Will it be an orc? A dragon? Or a demon instead?!<br><br><strong>Nope, she summons furriends, the pawsome and adorable little creatures to be her friend.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/5a0526d2607122f624728e7706c5d878.avif?t=1746332445\" width=614 height=154 /></span><br><br>But, how is this pawzzle rituals work...? How it can summon all those cute little furriends...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect the Dot + Merge Puzzle Mechanism</h2>Spawn Paw-friends by dragging the summoning circle around the tiles. Combines the summoning circles to create a new mix and reach the target to complete the level. Each animal have some unique requirements to be spawned, adding more complexity to the puzzles. Can you solve all the puzzles?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/5715a020c53bd56a7b2d605ef2e049f8.poster.avif?t=1746332445\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/5715a020c53bd56a7b2d605ef2e049f8.webm?t=1746332445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/5715a020c53bd56a7b2d605ef2e049f8.mp4?t=1746332445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>- Cute visuals &amp; sounds<br>- Relaxing music<br>- 20 Introduction Levels<br>- 3 cute themes",
    "about_the_game": "Once upon a time, there was a lonely witch and she wants to have friends to talk and play with.<br><br>Sadly, her timidness makes her being bashful everytime she tries to approach someone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/4882db4d36a36403dbb86588f0a72356.avif?t=1746332445\" width=614 height=154 /></span><br><br>Then one day, a brilliant idea popped out of the witch's head. With her skillful witchcraft, she decided to summon her own friends. But who or what will come out of the summoning portal?<br><br>Will it be an orc? A dragon? Or a demon instead?!<br><br><strong>Nope, she summons furriends, the pawsome and adorable little creatures to be her friend.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/5a0526d2607122f624728e7706c5d878.avif?t=1746332445\" width=614 height=154 /></span><br><br>But, how is this pawzzle rituals work...? How it can summon all those cute little furriends...?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect the Dot + Merge Puzzle Mechanism</h2>Spawn Paw-friends by dragging the summoning circle around the tiles. Combines the summoning circles to create a new mix and reach the target to complete the level. Each animal have some unique requirements to be spawned, adding more complexity to the puzzles. Can you solve all the puzzles?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/5715a020c53bd56a7b2d605ef2e049f8.poster.avif?t=1746332445\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/5715a020c53bd56a7b2d605ef2e049f8.webm?t=1746332445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981800/extras/5715a020c53bd56a7b2d605ef2e049f8.mp4?t=1746332445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2>- Cute visuals &amp; sounds<br>- Relaxing music<br>- 20 Introduction Levels<br>- 3 cute themes",
